</style><div class="slide" style="top:0; left:0;"><div class="s0"></div><img src="x-apple-ql-id://6AB698C6-065A-4A8B-944B-02B0A4A06D90/x-apple-ql-magic/4F7E3CC2-9EFB-4F51-AFD4-E3F6FE67A19F.pdf" style="position:absolute; top:-20; left:900; width:41; height:580;"><img src="x-apple-ql-id://39739DD5-A6D7-4BDA-A194-B525827009DB/x-apple-ql-magic/E508A18A-F54A-4B78-AB75-F0246851CFD8.pdf" style="position:absolute; top:-20; left:-12; width:41; height:580;"><img src="x-apple-ql-id://00463D74-FE27-4334-B96B-62604DF06F05/x-apple-ql-magic/D59D93C1-FB3C-49C5-8461-A31F812EC4DC.pdf" style="position:absolute; top:-20; left:924; width:41; height:580;"><img src="x-apple-ql-id://C448C3DC-D18A-4225-84EF-CA3D47D17EC8/x-apple-ql-magic/C1142AA2-BCF6-4862-83A1-18803BB4E88D.pdf" style="position:absolute; top:-20; left:908; width:72; height:580;"><img src="x-apple-ql-id://B6B40C31-092F-4A8B-87F7-7F57A0CA99EA/x-apple-ql-magic/E91EF3A6-D2C2-4C19-BFA1-85E3EE78ACF7.pdf" style="position:absolute; top:-20; left:916; width:41; height:580;"><img src="x-apple-ql-id://B9A0FB82-1858-4904-84F4-DC987B544038/x-apple-ql-magic/DE085F7D-28C8-46F5-A598-30E9EF3816B7.pdf" style="position:absolute; top:429; left:836; width:97; height:83;"><div style="position:absolute; top:21; left:48; width:784; height:90;"><div class="s7"><div class="s1"><p class="s33"> </p></div></div></div><div style="position:absolute; top:126; left:48; width:784; height:383;"><div class="s5"><p class="s40"><span class="s41">Нарушения пищеварения в желудке </span></p></div></div></div><style type="text/css">
