ass="s27">•</span><span class="s28">изжога </span></p><p class="s18"><span class="s27">•</span><span class="s28">отрыжка </span></p><p class="s18"><span class="s27">•</span><span class="s28">икота</span></p><p class="s18"><span class="s27">•</span><span class="s28">тошнота </span></p><p class="s18"><span class="s27">•</span><span class="s28">рвота </span><span class="s55"> </span></p></div></div></div><style type="text/css">
