ass="s43">антральный</span><span class="s43"> отдел</span></p><p class="s100"><span class="s27">•</span><span class="s43"> </span><span class="s43">Гиперсекреторный</span><span class="s43"> </span><span class="s43">гастрит </span></p><p class="s100"><span class="s27">•</span><span class="s43">У </span><span class="s43">этих пациентов может быть ассоциированная пептическая язва.</span></p></div></div><img src="x-apple-ql-id://82AF0646-5266-4AA3-96A4-6CEECD057452/x-apple-ql-magic/403E481A-15D2-4511-85E6-28CAAF1A8AEB.pdf" style="position:absolute; top:269; left:708; width:63; height:62;"><div style="overflow:hidden; position:absolute; top:87; left:421; width:538; height:414;"><img style="position:absolute; top:-356; left:-142; width:1648; height:968;" src="x-apple-ql-id://627C1836-A568-4F4A-BDB9-544411A5F32E/x-apple-ql-magic/2DA0BA5E-72F8-40D9-8388-CFAC13F3B554.png"></div><img src="x-apple-ql-id://5CC88EB6-4DCA-443E-B666-E55856269FFC/x-apple-ql-magic/8185D9F3-FEAC-4331-86CC-0F9FECD51444.pdf" style="position:absolute; top:209; left:697; width:63; height:62;"></div><style type="text/css">
