41">Хеликобактер</span><span class="s141">-ассоциированный</span></p></div></td><td class="s138"><div class="s142"><p class="s140"><span class="s141">Аутоиммунный</span></p></div></td></tr><tr><td class="s145"><div class="s137"><p class="s143"><span class="s144">Локализация</span></p></div></td><td class="s145"><div class="s139"><p class="s140"><span class="s144">Антральный</span><span class="s144"> отдел</span></p></div></td><td class="s145"><div class="s142"><p class="s140"><span class="s144">Тело желудка</span></p></div></td></tr><tr><td class="s146"><div class="s137"><p class="s143"><span class="s144">Воспалительный инфильтрат</span></p></div></td><td class="s146"><div class="s139"><p class="s140"><span class="s144">НФ, субэпителиальные плазматические клетки</span></p></div></td><td class="s146"><div class="s142"><p class="s140"><span class="s144">ЛЦ, МФ</span></p></div></td></tr><tr><td class="s145"><div class="s137"><p class="s143"><span class="s144">Продукция </span><span class="s144">HCl</span></p></div></td><td class="s145"><div class="s139"><p class="s140"><span class="s144">Увеличена или немного снижена</span></p></div></td><td class="s145"><div class="s142"><p class="s140"><span class="s144">Снижена</span></p></div></td></tr><tr><td class="s147"><div class="s137"><p class="s143"><span class="s144">Уровень </span><span class="s144">гастрина</span></p></div></td><td class="s147"><div class="s139"><p class="s140"><span class="s144">Нормальный или снижен</span></p></div></td><td class="s147"><div class="s142"><p class="s140"><span class="s144">Повышен</span></p></div></td></tr><tr><td class="s148"><div class="s137"><p class="s143"><span class="s144">Другие поражения</span></p></div></td><td class="s148"><div class="s139"><p class="s149"><span class="s144">Гиперпластические/</span></p><p class="s140"><span class="s144">воспалительные полипы</span></p></div></td><td class="s148"><div class="s142"><p class="s140"><span class="s144">Нейроэндокринная гиперплазия</span></p></div></td></tr><tr><td class="s147"><div class="s137"><p class="s143"><span class="s144">Серология</span></p></div></td><td class="s147"><div class="s139"><p class="s140"><span class="s144">АТ к </span><span class="s144">HP</span></p></div></td><td class="s147"><div class="s142"><p class="s140"><span class="s144">АТ</span><span class="s144"> к </span><span class="s144">париэтальным</span><span class="s144"> </span><span class="s144">кл</span><span class="s144">. </span></p></div></td></tr><tr><td class="s150"><div class="s137"><p class="s143"><span class="s144">Последствия</span></p></div></td><td class="s150"><div class="s139"><p class="s140"><span class="s144">Пептическая язва, </span><span class="s144">аденокарцинома</span></p></div></td><td class="s150"><div class="s142"><p class="s149"><span class="s151">Атрофия, </span><span class="s151">перниц</span><span class="s151">. анемия, </span><span class="s151">аденокарцинома</span><span class="s151">, </span><span class="s151">карциноидная</span><span class="s151"> опухоль</span></p></div></td></tr><tr><td class="s152"><div class="s137"><p class="s143"><span class="s144">Факторы риска</span></p></div></td><td class="s152"><div class="s139"><p class="s143"><span class="s151">Низкий соц.-эконом. статус, проживание в сельской местности</span></p></div></td><td class="s152"><div class="s142"><p class="s6"><span class="s151">АИЗ (</span><span class="s151">тиреоидит,СД</span><span class="s151">, б-</span><span class="s151">нь</span><span class="s151"> </span><span class="s151">Грейвса</span><span class="s151">) &nbsp; &nbsp;</span></p><p class="s140"> </p></div></td></tr></table></div><style type="text/css">
