</style><div class="slide" style="top:0; left:0;"><div class="s0"></div><img src="x-apple-ql-id://6AB698C6-065A-4A8B-944B-02B0A4A06D90/x-apple-ql-magic/4F7E3CC2-9EFB-4F51-AFD4-E3F6FE67A19F.pdf" style="position:absolute; top:-20; left:900; width:41; height:580;"><img src="x-apple-ql-id://39739DD5-A6D7-4BDA-A194-B525827009DB/x-apple-ql-magic/E508A18A-F54A-4B78-AB75-F0246851CFD8.pdf" style="position:absolute; top:-20; left:-12; width:41; height:580;"><img src="x-apple-ql-id://00463D74-FE27-4334-B96B-62604DF06F05/x-apple-ql-magic/D59D93C1-FB3C-49C5-8461-A31F812EC4DC.pdf" style="position:absolute; top:-20; left:924; width:41; height:580;"><img src="x-apple-ql-id://C448C3DC-D18A-4225-84EF-CA3D47D17EC8/x-apple-ql-magic/C1142AA2-BCF6-4862-83A1-18803BB4E88D.pdf" style="position:absolute; top:-20; left:908; width:72; height:580;"><img src="x-apple-ql-id://B6B40C31-092F-4A8B-87F7-7F57A0CA99EA/x-apple-ql-magic/E91EF3A6-D2C2-4C19-BFA1-85E3EE78ACF7.pdf" style="position:absolute; top:-20; left:916; width:41; height:580;"><img src="x-apple-ql-id://B9A0FB82-1858-4904-84F4-DC987B544038/x-apple-ql-magic/DE085F7D-28C8-46F5-A598-30E9EF3816B7.pdf" style="position:absolute; top:429; left:836; width:97; height:83;"><div style="position:absolute; top:21; left:48; width:784; height:90;"><div class="s7"><div class="s1"><p class="s3"><span class="s211">Синдром </span><span class="s211">мальабсорбции</span><span class="s211"> </span></p></div></div></div><img src="x-apple-ql-id://2321E2AB-AB0D-457F-916C-154D931491EA/x-apple-ql-magic/983419D0-1C7B-490E-B863-C181EEAF3BC3.pdf" style="position:absolute; top:444; left:242; width:459; height:102;"><div style="position:absolute; top:126; left:48; width:784; height:383;"><div class="s5"><p class="s212"><span class="s213">•</span><span class="s63">может </span><span class="s63">быть </span><span class="s214">первичным </span><span class="s63">или </span><span class="s214">вторичным</span><span class="s63">. </span></p><p class="s215"> </p><p class="s212"><span class="s213">•</span><span class="s214">Первичный СМ </span><span class="s63">- &nbsp;нарушение транспорта </span><span class="s63">(недостаточность ферментов-переносчиков) аминокислот в тонкой кишке. </span><span class="s63">Например, </span></p><p class="s215"><span class="s213">➢</span><span class="s63">- аминокислот </span><span class="s63">(болезнь </span><span class="s63">Хартнапа</span><span class="s63"> - </span><span class="s63">пеллагрические</span><span class="s63"> изменения кожи, мозжечковая </span><span class="s63">атаксия; синдром </span><span class="s63">Лоу</span><span class="s63"> - врожденная катаракта, глаукома, гипертония, остеопороз, умственная отсталость), </span></p><p class="s212"><span class="s213">➢</span><span class="s63">глюкозы </span><span class="s63">и </span><span class="s63">галактозы (отсутствует </span><span class="s63">фермент </span><span class="s63">глюкозо-6-фосфатаза);</span></p><p class="s212"><span class="s213">➢</span><span class="s63">фруктозы (дефицит фруктозо-1-фосфатальдолазы); </span></p><p class="s212"><span class="s213">➢</span><span class="s63">первичная </span><span class="s63">мальабсорбция</span><span class="s63"> витамина В12 или фолиевой кислоты ведет к развитию </span><span class="s63">мегалобластной</span><span class="s63"> анемии. </span></p></div></div><img src="x-apple-ql-id://D0E4FF3F-0688-482A-BBB4-26D3303210EC/x-apple-ql-magic/2DE25D0A-13F4-4B4A-8AD4-C5E05465F5A5.pdf" style="position:absolute; top:378; left:215; width:410; height:82;"></div><style type="text/css">
.s216.s216.s216 {margin-top:3px; margin-left:7px; margin-bottom:3px; margin-right:7px; display:table; top:-10000; left:0; width:784; height:10045; position:absolute;}
.s217.s217.s217 {font-family:"Times New Roman"; font-size:24;}
</style><div class="slide" style="top:0; left:0;"><div class="s0"></div><img src="x-apple-ql-id://6AB698C6-065A-4A8B-944B-02B0A4A06D90/x-apple-ql-magic/4F7E3CC2-9EFB-4F51-AFD4-E3F6FE67A19F.pdf" style="position:absolute; top:-20; left:900; width:41; height:580;"><img src="x-apple-ql-id://39739DD5-A6D7-4BDA-A194-B525827009DB/x-apple-ql-magic/E508A18A-F54A-4B78-AB75-F0246851CFD8.pdf" style="position:absolute; top:-20; left:-12; width:41; height:580;"><img src="x-apple-ql-id://00463D74-FE27-4334-B96B-62604DF06F05/x-apple-ql-magic/D59D93C1-FB3C-49C5-8461-A31F812EC4DC.pdf" style="position:absolute; top:-20; left:924; width:41; height:580;"><img src="x-apple-ql-id://C448C3DC-D18A-4225-84EF-CA3D47D17EC8/x-apple-ql-magic/C1142AA2-BCF6-4862-83A1-18803BB4E88D.pdf" style="position:absolute; top:-20; left:908; width:72; height:580;"><img src="x-apple-ql-id://B6B40C31-092F-4A8B-87F7-7F57A0CA99EA/x-apple-ql-magic/E91EF3A6-D2C2-4C19-BFA1-85E3EE78ACF7.pdf" style="position:absolute; top:-20; left:916; width:41; height:580;"><img src="x-apple-ql-id://B9A0FB82-1858-4904-84F4-DC987B544038/x-apple-ql-magic/DE085F7D-28C8-46F5-A598-30E9EF3816B7.pdf" style="position:absolute; top:429; left:836; width:97; height:83;"><div style="position:absolute; top:18; left:44; width:784; height:45;"><div class="s216"><div class="s1"><p class="s3"><span class="s211">Синдром </span><span class="s211">мальабсорбции</span><span class="s211"> </span></p></div></div></div><img src="x-apple-ql-id://D0E4FF3F-0688-482A-BBB4-26D3303210EC/x-apple-ql-magic/2DE25D0A-13F4-4B4A-8AD4-C5E05465F5A5.pdf" style="position:absolute; top:378; left:215; width:410; height:82;"><div style="position:absolute; top:70; left:48; width:848; height:455;"><div class="s5"><p class="s217"><span class="s214">Вторичный</span><span class="s63">. Причины: </span></p><p class="s24"><span class="s30">•</span><span class="s63">1) недостаточное расщепление пищи в </span><span class="s63">желудке; </span></p><p class="s24"><span class="s30">•</span><span class="s63">2) экзокринная панкреатическая </span><span class="s63">недостаточность; </span></p><p class="s24"><span class="s30">•</span><span class="s63">3) заболевания </span><span class="s63">печени; </span></p><p class="s24"><span class="s30">•</span><span class="s63">4) ишемическая </span><span class="s63">энтеропатия</span><span class="s63"> с возможным инфарктом </span><span class="s63">кишечника; </span></p><p class="s24"><span class="s30">•</span><span class="s63">5) воспаление тонкой кишки различной </span><span class="s63">этиологии; </span></p><p class="s24"><span class="s30">•</span><span class="s63">6) </span><span class="s63">дисбактериоз</span><span class="s63">;</span></p><p class="s24"><span class="s30">•</span><span class="s63">7</span><span class="s63">) лучевая (радиационная) </span><span class="s63">энтеропатия</span><span class="s63">; </span></p><p class="s24"><span class="s30">•</span><span class="s63">8) резекция части тонкой кишки (синдром короткой кишки), </span></p><p class="s18"><span class="s30">•</span><span class="s63">9</span><span class="s63">) кишечная непроходимость в верхних отделах </span><span class="s63">кишки; </span></p><p class="s24"><span class="s30">•</span><span class="s63">10</span><span class="s63">) двигательные расстройства </span><span class="s63">кишечника</span><span class="s63">;</span><span class="s63"> </span></p><p class="s18"><span class="s30">•</span><span class="s63">11) </span><span class="s63">сердечно-сосудистые болезни; </span><span class="s63">закупорка лимфатических путей; </span></p><p class="s24"><span class="s30">•</span><span class="s63">12) </span><span class="s63">иммунодефицит, эндокринные </span><span class="s63">нарушения.</span></p></div></div><img src="x-apple-ql-id://2321E2AB-AB0D-457F-916C-154D931491EA/x-apple-ql-magic/983419D0-1C7B-490E-B863-C181EEAF3BC3.pdf" style="position:absolute; top:444; left:242; width:459; height:102;"></div><div class="slide" style="top:0; left:0;"><div class="s0"></div><img src="x-apple-ql-id://6AB698C6-065A-4A8B-944B-02B0A4A06D90/x-apple-ql-magic/4F7E3CC2-9EFB-4F51-AFD4-E3F6FE67A19F.pdf" style="position:absolute; top:-20; left:900; width:41; height:580;"><img src="x-apple-ql-id://39739DD5-A6D7-4BDA-A194-B525827009DB/x-apple-ql-magic/E508A18A-F54A-4B78-AB75-F0246851CFD8.pdf" style="position:absolute; top:-20; left:-12; width:41; height:580;"><img src="x-apple-ql-id://00463D74-FE27-4334-B96B-62604DF06F05/x-apple-ql-magic/D59D93C1-FB3C-49C5-8461-A31F812EC4DC.pdf" style="position:absolute; top:-20; left:924; width:41; height:580;"><img src="x-apple-ql-id://C448C3DC-D18A-4225-84EF-CA3D47D17EC8/x-apple-ql-magic/C1142AA2-BCF6-4862-83A1-18803BB4E88D.pdf" style="position:absolute; top:-20; left:908; width:72; height:580;"><img src="x-apple-ql-id://B6B40C31-092F-4A8B-87F7-7F57A0CA99EA/x-apple-ql-magic/E91EF3A6-D2C2-4C19-BFA1-85E3EE78ACF7.pdf" style="position:absolute; top:-20; left:916; width:41; height:580;"><img src="x-apple-ql-id://B9A0FB82-1858-4904-84F4-DC987B544038/x-apple-ql-magic/DE085F7D-28C8-46F5-A598-30E9EF3816B7.pdf" style="position:absolute; top:429; left:836; width:97; height:83;"><div style="position:absolute; top:21; left:48; width:784; height:90;"><div class="s7"><div class="s1"><p class="s48"><span class="s211">Клинические проявления СМ</span></p></div></div></div><img src="x-apple-ql-id://2321E2AB-AB0D-457F-916C-154D931491EA/x-apple-ql-magic/983419D0-1C7B-490E-B863-C181EEAF3BC3.pdf" style="position:absolute; top:444; left:242; width:459; height:102;"><div style="position:absolute; top:126; left:48; width:784; height:383;"><div class="s5"><p class="s10"><span class="s14">•</span><span class="s16">Похудание (у детей – задержка роста и инфантилизм</span><span class="s16">).</span></p><p class="s18"><span class="s14">•</span><span class="s16"> Геморрагический синдром. </span></p><p class="s18"><span class="s14">•</span><span class="s16">Общий </span><span class="s16">анемический </span><span class="s16">синдром. </span></p><p class="s18"><span class="s14">•</span><span class="s16">Сидеропенический</span><span class="s16"> синдром. </span></p><p class="s18"><span class="s14">•</span><span class="s16">Дисэлектролитный</span><span class="s16"> синдром. </span></p><p class="s18"><span class="s14">•</span><span class="s16">Гиповитаминоз. </span></p><p class="s17"><span class="s14">•</span><span class="s16">Синдром </span><span class="s16">белково</span><span class="s16">-энергетической </span><span class="s16">недостаточности.</span></p></div></div><img src="x-apple-ql-id://D0E4FF3F-0688-482A-BBB4-26D3303210EC/x-apple-ql-magic/2DE25D0A-13F4-4B4A-8AD4-C5E05465F5A5.pdf" style="position:absolute; top:378; left:215; width:410; height:82;"></div><div class="slide" style="top:0; left:0;"><div class="s0"></div><img src="x-apple-ql-id://6AB698C6-065A-4A8B-944B-02B0A4A06D90/x-apple-ql-magic/4F7E3CC2-9EFB-4F51-AFD4-E3F6FE67A19F.pdf" style="position:absolute; top:-20; left:900; width:41; height:580;"><img src="x-apple-ql-id://39739DD5-A6D7-4BDA-A194-B525827009DB/x-apple-ql-magic/E508A18A-F54A-4B78-AB75-F0246851CFD8.pdf" style="position:absolute; top:-20; left:-12; width:41; height:580;"><img src="x-apple-ql-id://00463D74-FE27-4334-B96B-62604DF06F05/x-apple-ql-magic/D59D93C1-FB3C-49C5-8461-A31F812EC4DC.pdf" style="position:absolute; top:-20; left:924; width:41; height:580;"><img src="x-apple-ql-id://C448C3DC-D18A-4225-84EF-CA3D47D17EC8/x-apple-ql-magic/C1142AA2-BCF6-4862-83A1-18803BB4E88D.pdf" style="position:absolute; top:-20; left:908; width:72; height:580;"><img src="x-apple-ql-id://B6B40C31-092F-4A8B-87F7-7F57A0CA99EA/x-apple-ql-magic/E91EF3A6-D2C2-4C19-BFA1-85E3EE78ACF7.pdf" style="position:absolute; top:-20; left:916; width:41; height:580;"><img src="x-apple-ql-id://B9A0FB82-1858-4904-84F4-DC987B544038/x-apple-ql-magic/DE085F7D-28C8-46F5-A598-30E9EF3816B7.pdf" style="position:absolute; top:429; left:836; width:97; height:83;"><div style="position:absolute; top:21; left:48; width:784; height:90;"><div class="s7"><div class="s1"><p class="s33"> </p></div></div></div><img src="x-apple-ql-id://D0E4FF3F-0688-482A-BBB4-26D3303210EC/x-apple-ql-magic/2DE25D0A-13F4-4B4A-8AD4-C5E05465F5A5.pdf" style="position:absolute; top:378; left:215; width:410; height:82;"><div style="position:absolute; top:126; left:48; width:784; height:383;"><div class="s5"><p class="s10"> </p></div></div><img src="x-apple-ql-id://2321E2AB-AB0D-457F-916C-154D931491EA/x-apple-ql-magic/983419D0-1C7B-490E-B863-C181EEAF3BC3.pdf" style="position:absolute; top:444; left:242; width:459; height:102;"><img src="x-apple-ql-id://FD0D1EFD-908B-45F1-A3E9-892E542E187E/x-apple-ql-magic/1B9BFCCD-209B-4BF6-898C-D3EBB96810B6.png" style="position:absolute; top:15; left:116; width:712; height:519;"><img src="x-apple-ql-id://22EA5968-C38F-4AC9-B1C0-8F55D6480941/x-apple-ql-magic/68343A78-7882-4638-8FC5-BEC3234779C2.pdf" style="position:absolute; top:283; left:576; width:371; height:96;"></div><div class="slide" style="top:0; left:0;"><div class="s0"></div><img src="x-apple-ql-id://6AB698C6-065A-4A8B-944B-02B0A4A06D90/x-apple-ql-magic/4F7E3CC2-9EFB-4F51-AFD4-E3F6FE67A19F.pdf" style="position:absolute; top:-20; left:900; width:41; height:580;"><img src="x-apple-ql-id://39739DD5-A6D7-4BDA-A194-B525827009DB/x-apple-ql-magic/E508A18A-F54A-4B78-AB75-F0246851CFD8.pdf" style="position:absolute; top:-20; left:-12; width:41; height:580;"><img src="x-apple-ql-id://00463D74-FE27-4334-B96B-62604DF06F05/x-apple-ql-magic/D59D93C1-FB3C-49C5-8461-A31F812EC4DC.pdf" style="position:absolute; top:-20; left:924; width:41; height:580;"><img src="x-apple-ql-id://C448C3DC-D18A-4225-84EF-CA3D47D17EC8/x-apple-ql-magic/C1142AA2-BCF6-4862-83A1-18803BB4E88D.pdf" style="position:absolute; top:-20; left:908; width:72; height:580;"><img src="x-apple-ql-id://B6B40C31-092F-4A8B-87F7-7F57A0CA99EA/x-apple-ql-magic/E91EF3A6-D2C2-4C19-BFA1-85E3EE78ACF7.pdf" style="position:absolute; top:-20; left:916; width:41; height:580;"><img src="x-apple-ql-id://B9A0FB82-1858-4904-84F4-DC987B544038/x-apple-ql-magic/DE085F7D-28C8-46F5-A598-30E9EF3816B7.pdf" style="position:absolute; top:429; left:836; width:97; height:83;"><div style="position:absolute; top:21; left:48; width:784; height:90;"><div class="s7"><div class="s1"><p class="s33"> </p></div></div></div><img src="x-apple-ql-id://22EA5968-C38F-4AC9-B1C0-8F55D6480941/x-apple-ql-magic/68343A78-7882-4638-8FC5-BEC3234779C2.pdf" style="position:absolute; top:283; left:576; width:371; height:96;"><div style="position:absolute; top:126; left:48; width:784; height:383;"><div class="s5"><p class="s59"><span class="s209">Благодарю за внимание!</span></p></div></div><img src="x-apple-ql-id://BAEEDABF-A6AB-4D8D-8CA3-950BC8216432/x-apple-ql-magic/4ADCB0F2-626B-4876-9738-2F8BA9F9F575.pdf" style="position:absolute; top:406; left:-5; width:241; height:109;"></div></body></html>